  "articleBody": "Replacing kitchen cabinets can improve storage, appearance, and workflow, but the right scope depends on whether plumbing, electrical connections, walls, flooring, and countertops remain in place. Before hiring, compare cabinet construction, layout changes, installation details, removal, design coordination, permits, and the contractor’s plan for protecting the rest of the home.",
